    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_490eabb6_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "The foundation of any good canopy is a frame. Not only are our frames strong, sturdy and durable, they’re also lightweight and easy to assemble. They’re the first thing you need to consider when picking the perfect canopy. The options for frames range by sizes and materials. You can learn more about our frames here.<br><br>Once you have decided on a frame, we can start getting creative with a top. Impact’s Instant Canopies are equipped with a premium 500 denier polyester top that is water, mildew and rot resistant and meets ULCS 109, CPAI 84 and NFPA 701 Fire codes. The great thing about custom printed canopies is that they are specifically designed with your needs in mind. Digitally printed products from Impact Canopy can be matched to virtually any Pantone solid-coated color. No matter what color you use in your branding, Impact Canopy will be able to match it – or find a close alternative with more cost-effective choices depending on your needs.<br>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_072f687e_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Canopy Specifications"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_bf4f9361_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Impact canopy offers a variety of frames to fit every need. Not sure which frame is right for you? Contact us and we will be happy to assist you in getting the perfect canopy! Here are some more details on our most popular frames:<br><br>DS Steel Frame: This frame is a lightweight powder coated steel frame with plastic fittings. The foot pads are nylon fiberglass that are reinforced with steel. The DS Frame is also available in black and it comes in sizes 5′ x 5′, 8′ x 8′, 8′ x 12′, and 10′ x 10′. See the DS Frame specs here.<br><br>CL Steel frame: This Frame is our heavy duty industrial steel frame with nylon fittings and steel foot pads. The CL Frame is also available in black and it comes in sizes 10′ x 10′, 10′ x 15′, and 10′ x 20′. See the CL Frame specs here.<br><br>10×10 ML Aluminum Frame: This frame is our lightest frame made with industrial aluminum. It includes reinforced cross bars, double sided brackets and is rust resistant. It comes in sizes 10′ x 10′, 10′ x 15′, and 10′ x 20′. See the ML Frame specs here.<br><br>10×10 M Aluminum Frame: This frame is our heavy duty, aircraft grade aluminum frame. It includes similar features to our ML frame, but is thicker making it one of our most durable frames. It comes in sizes 10′ x 10′, 10′ x 15′, and 10′ x 20‘. See the M Frame specs here.<br><br>MegaX Aluminum Frame: This frame is our most durable commercial grade aluminum frame. With an anodized aluminum brush finish and and nylon fiberglass connectors, it is unmatched in the instant canopy industry. The MegaX offers a wide variety of sizes including 10′ x 10′, 13′ x 20′, 13′ x 26′, 16′ x 16′, and 20′ x 20′. See the MegaX specs here.<br><br>All of our tops are Water Repellent &amp; UV Coated and meet ULC-S109, CPAI-84 and NFPA 701 Fire Resistant Requirements.<br>"
    },
